              "editor": "<p>Tyler spent eight years in sales chasing a number nobody in company history had ever hit. The year she finally hit it, she wanted a marching band down the hall, cheerleaders, glitter falling from the sky. She got a congratulations email and a nice lunch. And in January, her ticker flipped back to zero.</p>",
